@startuml 用例图
' 鲲鹏运维平台 UML 用例图: 小人(参与者) + 椭圆(用例) + 直线关联
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam actorStyle stickman
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor #EAF1FB
  BorderColor #2F5CAC
  ArrowColor #1D2433
}
skinparam actor {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #1D2433
}
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFD
  BorderColor #94A7C4
}

actor "成员" as member
actor "管理员" as admin

rectangle "鲲鹏运维平台" {
  ' 左列: 核心功能
  usecase "登录认证" as UC1
  usecase "工作台总览" as UC2
  usecase "上传日志分析" as UC3
  usecase "智能巡检日志" as UC4
  usecase "查看分析报告" as UC5
  usecase "查看性能图表" as UC6

  ' 右列: 管理功能
  usecase "用户权限管理" as UC7
  usecase "查看审计日志" as UC8
  usecase "成员审批" as UC9
  usecase "规则管理" as UC10
  usecase "资产库管理" as UC11
}

' 成员 -> 核心功能
member --> UC1
member --> UC2
member --> UC3
member --> UC4
member --> UC5
member --> UC6

' 管理员 -> 管理功能 (并拥有成员全部权限)
admin --> UC7
admin --> UC8
admin --> UC9
admin --> UC10
admin --> UC11

note bottom of admin
  管理员为平台管理员、队长、团队管理员
  三类管理角色的统称,
  拥有成员的全部权限
end note
note bottom of UC1
  登录认证适用于所有角色
end note
@enduml
